WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.740
A child sits on a
spinning playground ride,

2
00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:05.610
going around once every 4 seconds.

3
00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:09.460
Around and around, at a
perfectly steady speed.

4
00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:12.000
Now a car takes a long bend.

5
00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:14.420
Its speedometer needle never moves.

6
00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:17.060
No speeding up, no slowing down.

7
00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:19.540
So is it accelerating at all?

8
00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:21.870
And if it is, how much?

9
00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:26.920
In this mission, you'll link the time for
one turn to the speed around the circle.

10
00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:29.430
Then you'll put numbers
on that playground ride,

11
00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:31.060
step by step.

12
00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:34.490
Your mission: decide whether
the car is accelerating,

13
00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:36.050
and work out how much.
